From bb10af11d2d29b6dadfaac63a7e889afe4a28184 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rohit Gudi <50377477+caretak3r@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:04:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] build(hip0025-wire): ordered overlay for trees that contain
 PR1 (harness only)

Routes chart-v3 install/upgrade through PR1's executor on --wait=ordered and
stores the plan; rollback follows the target revision's plan; uninstall is
reverse-sequenced only for releases installed sequenced; upgrade and rollback
delete removed objects in reverse order of the replaced revision's plan.

Signed-off-by: Rohit Gudi <50377477+caretak3r@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 pkg/action/wire_ordered_v3.go | 212 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 212 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 pkg/action/wire_ordered_v3.go

diff --git a/pkg/action/wire_ordered_v3.go b/pkg/action/wire_ordered_v3.go
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..aba0f0d5c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/pkg/action/wire_ordered_v3.go
@@ -0,0 +1,212 @@
